  "html": "<p><strong>LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation，低秩自适应)</strong> 是一种高效的大模型参数微调技术（PEFT, Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning）。其核心思想和SVD分解里的秩很像，如果只是让模型修改下某一个方面的能力，理论上不需要把所有参数重新训练调整一边，只需要调整一部分就行。</p><p>换句话说，如果你能清楚知道修改模型的哪几个参数，可以直接把其他参数冻结，只动那指定的几个位置的参数就行，但我们并不知道具体改那几个参数，因此LoRA提出了外接小矩阵参数的方式，通过模型学习到去调整哪些参数。</p><hr><p>参考链接：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1PvwYzxE9D/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=8c065934da63850a7afd383a2017d263\">什么是LoRA 大模型微调是怎么回事_哔哩哔哩_bilibili  </a>，<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.09685\">论文</a></p><h2><strong>核心思想与原理</strong></h2><p><span>在大语言模型（如 LLaMA、GPT）中，参数矩阵的维度极大（例如 <span data-tex=\"d \\times k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span>）。全量微调需要更新所有的权重 <span data-tex=\"W\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span>，计算与存储开销极高。</span></p><p><span>LoRA 基于一个核心假设：<strong>模型在适配特定下游任务时，权重的变化量 <span data-tex=\"\\Delta W\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span> 具有较低的“本征秩”（Intrinsic Rank）</strong>。这意味着并不需要学习整个 <span data-tex=\"d \\times k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span> 维度的变化，只需将其分解为两个小矩阵相乘即可：</span></p><div data-tex=\"\\Delta W = B \\cdot A\" data-type=\"math-block\" class=\"math-node math-block\"></div><ul><li><p>原始权重 <span><span data-tex=\"W \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 在微调过程中<strong>完全冻结（Freeze）</strong>。</p></li><li><p>引入两个可训练的低秩矩阵：<span><span data-tex=\"A \\in \\mathbb{R}^{r \\times k}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 和 <span><span data-tex=\"B \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times r}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，其中秩 <span><span data-tex=\"r \\ll \\min(d, k)\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>（通常取 <span><span data-tex=\"r = 4, 8, 16\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>）。</p></li><li><p>最终的前向传播计算公式为：</p><div data-tex=\"h = W x + \\Delta W x = W x + \\frac{\\alpha}{r} (B A x)\" data-type=\"math-block\" class=\"math-node math-block\"></div><p><em>(其中 </em><span><em><span data-tex=\"\\frac{\\alpha}{r}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></em></span><em> 为常数缩放因子，用于稳定训练。)</em></p></li></ul><p><strong>核心优势</strong>：</p><ol><li><p><strong>显存占用极低</strong>：只需保存和更新 <span><span data-tex=\"A\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 和 <span><span data-tex=\"B\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的梯度，可训练参数量直接降低 1,000 到 10,000 倍。</p></li><li><p><strong>零推理延迟（Zero Inference Latency）</strong>：训练完成后，直接将 <span><span data-tex=\"B \\cdot A\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 加回原始权重 <span><span data-tex=\"W_{\\text{new}} = W + \\frac{\\alpha}{r} (B A)\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，推理时不需要额外的结构调整或计算量。</p></li></ol><p><strong>极简代码实现示例 (PyTorch)</strong></p><pre><code>import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\nclass LoRALinear(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, in_features, out_features, rank=4, alpha=1.0):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 1. 原始预训练权重（冻结，不参与梯度更新）\n        self.pretrained_weight = nn.Parameter(\n            torch.randn(out_features, in_features), \n            requires_grad=False\n        )\n        \n        # 2. 引入 low-rank 矩阵 A 和 B\n        self.rank = rank\n        self.scaling = alpha / rank\n        \n        self.lora_A = nn.Parameter(torch.randn(rank, in_features))\n        self.lora_B = nn.Parameter(torch.zeros(out_features, rank))\n        \n        # 初始化策略：A 用高斯分布初始化，B 初始化为全 0\n        # 保证在训练开始时 BA = 0，模型行为与原模型完全一致\n        nn.init.kaiming_uniform_(self.lora_A, a=5**0.5)\n        nn.init.zeros_(self.lora_B)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # 原始线性变换: W * x\n        base_output = torch.matmul(x, self.pretrained_weight.T)\n        \n        # LoRA 增量变换: (B * A) * x * scaling\n        lora_delta = torch.matmul(x, self.lora_A.T) # x: (batch, in_f) -&gt; (batch, r)\n        lora_delta = torch.matmul(lora_delta, self.lora_B.T) # (batch, r) -&gt; (batch, out_f)\n        \n        return base_output + lora_delta * self.scaling\n\n# --- 测试代码 ---\nx = torch.randn(2, 512) # 输入 batch_size=2, in_features=512\nlora_layer = LoRALinear(in_features=512, out_features=1024, rank=8)\n\noutput = lora_layer(x)\nprint(\"输出形状:\", output.shape) # 形状与普通 Linear 层完全相同: [2, 1024]</code></pre><h2>为什么需要再乘以系数<span><span data-tex=\"\\frac{\\alpha}{r}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span></h2><p>在 LoRA 中，常数缩放因子（通常记为 <span><span data-tex=\"\\frac{\\alpha}{r}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，其中 <span><span data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 为超参数, <span><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 为秩 Rank）的主要作用是：<strong>在调整或试验不同的秩 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 时，平衡 LoRA 权重与原始权重的比例，并稳定训练过程，无需重新调整学习率（Learning Rate）</strong>。</p><p>其公式表达为：</p><div data-tex=\"h = W_0 x + \\frac{\\alpha}{r} \\cdot (BA) x\" data-type=\"math-block\" class=\"math-node math-block\"></div><h3>为什么需要这个缩放因子？</h3><p>主要有以下三个关键原因：</p><p><strong>1. 确保初始训练的稳定性（平衡梯度和特征幅度）</strong></p><p>在矩阵乘法 <span><span data-tex=\"B \\cdot A\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 中：</p><ul><li><p>矩阵 <span><span data-tex=\"A\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的维度是 <span><span data-tex=\"r \\times k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span></p></li><li><p>矩阵 <span><span data-tex=\"B\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的维度是 <span><span data-tex=\"d \\times r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span></p></li></ul><p>当增加秩 <span><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>（比如从 <span><span data-tex=\"r=4\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 增大到 <span><span data-tex=\"r=64\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>）时，参与相乘求和的中间特征数量会成倍增加。如果不做缩放，随着 <span><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的增大，输出增量 <span><span data-tex=\"\\Delta W x = BAx\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的<strong>数值幅度（Magnitude）和梯度（Gradient）都会随之放大</strong>。</p><p>加上 <span><span data-tex=\"\\frac{1}{r}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的除法项后，可以<strong>抵消掉因为秩 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 增大而带来的输出数值放大效应</strong>，保持输出特征在数量级上的稳定。</p><p><strong>2. 解耦“秩选择 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong>”与“学习率 Hyperparameter”</strong></p><p>在模型调优过程中，工程师通常需要测试不同的秩 <span><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>（如尝试 <span><span data-tex=\"r \\in \\{4, 8, 16, 32, 64\\}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>）。</p><ul><li><p><strong>如果没有缩放因子</strong>：当你改变 <span><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 时，<span><span data-tex=\"\\Delta W\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的输出规模发生改变，你往往需要重新去调优（Tuning）学习率 Learning Rate（例如 <span><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 变大时学习率可能要调小）。</p></li><li><p><strong>有了 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\frac{\\alpha}{r}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 缩放因子</strong>：由于 <span><span data-tex=\"\\frac{\\alpha}{r}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 会根据 <span><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的变化自动按比例调整权重大小，你可以<strong>直接更换不同的 </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"r\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong>，而无需重新寻找最优学习率</strong>。</p></li></ul><p><strong>3. 手动控制 LoRA 对原模型的“影响权重” (</strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong>)</strong></p><p><span><span data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>（Alpha）是一个固定的常数超参数（常见设置如 <span><span data-tex=\"\\alpha = 16\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 或 <span><span data-tex=\"\\alpha = 32\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>）。</p><p>通过调整 <span><span data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，你可以显式地控制 LoRA 分支输出占总输出的强度比例：</p><ul><li><p><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 调大</strong>：增大 LoRA 增量 <span><span data-tex=\"\\Delta W\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的权重，让模型更强地拟合新任务的数据特点（适合新任务与原任务差异较大的场景）。</p></li><li><p><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 调小</strong>：降低 LoRA 的影响，更多依赖预训练模型的原始知识 <span><span data-tex=\"W_0\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>（适合防止模型过拟合或知识遗忘）。</p></li></ul>"
}